members.doc:
Merge another config file into this one without clearing.
overwriteExisting=true — the file's values win (higher tier);
false — only fills keys this config lacks (lower tier).

types.doc:
One row. Aliases are other current spellings of the same format (.jpeg);
Legacy are spellings an older engine wrote, read and migrated but never
written. Both are space-separated, dot included, lowercase. PackageClasses
are the classes an asset package of this type declares in its summary;
AssetType is the FAssetTypeUtils name the registry files it under.
